<title>ITALY: Trading in Gemina shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Gemina shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in industrial holding company Gemina was suspended until further notice, the Milan bourse council said on Friday.</p>
<p>Gemina is holding an extraordinary board meeting today and is expected to issue a statement later. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
